html
  head
    title MyClip
    meta(name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1')
    link(rel='icon' type='image/svg+xml' href='/favicon.svg')
    style
      include ./style.css
    script(src='./result.js')
  body
    h1
      img(class='logo' src='/favicon.svg' alt='')
      | Clip stored successfully
    p Share the following URL to access data:
    div(class='code') 
      a(id='link' href= href)= href
    button(id='copy' class='copy') Copy URL to clipboard
    br
    br
    p You can also curl/wget to get the data
    div(class='code') curl 
       span= href
    br
    br
    a(href=URL class='button new') new clip